"{{Term/Store|EX Royal Guard Rumors||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|EX Royal Guard Rumors}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Riverside Stable}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TCB}} [[Downloadable Content]] Pack.

==Overview==
This [[Side Quest]] is obtained upon reaching leaving the [[Great Plateau]] and loading the overworld of [[Hyrule Kingdom]], which can be done by [[Warping]], reloading a save file, dying, or leaving an [[Ancient Shrine]]. When the Quest is activated, [[Link]] will be tasked with finding a copy of ''[[Super Rumor Mill EX]]'', which is located in the [[Riverside Stable]].<ref>{{Cite|Apparently {{Color BotW|Red|Riverside Stable}} has a copy of Super Rumor Mill EX, which details some rumors about this rare outfit.|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to activate the second stage of this Side Quest by reading the ''Super Rumor Mill V4'' without triggering any of the loading conditions for its activation.}}

The ''[[Super Rumor Mill V4]]'' is found on a table inside Riverside Stable. In the book, [[Traysi]] discusses the [[Royal Guard]]s and hearsay that their [[Armor]] can still be found in [[Hyrule Castle (Dungeon)|Hyrule Castle]].<ref>{{Cite|This tidbit is about the brave soldiers who were tragically wiped out during the Great Calamity. {{Big|The royal guards who protected the royal family!}} Amongst {{Color BotW|Blue|Hyrule's soldiers}}, only the best of the best had the honor of guarding the royal family. Apparently, the equipment they wore can still be found somewhere in {{Color BotW|Blue|Hyrule Castle}}.|Super Rumor Mill V4|BotW}}</ref> According to a former maid, the equipment can be found in the [[Dining Hall]], the [[Guards' Chamber]], and the second floor.<ref>{{Cite|hey say a former maid spoke of treasure near the {{Color BotW|Red|Dining Hall}}, in the {{Color BotW|Red|Guards' Chamber}}, and on the {{Color BotW|Red|second floor}}.|Super Rumor Mill V4|BotW}}</ref>

The [[Treasure Chest]] containing the [[Royal Guard Cap]] is on the second floor of the [[Sanctum]], in the room directly above where [[Princess Zelda|Zelda]] has sealed [[Calamity Ganon]], in front of a statue of a knight. The [[Royal Guard Uniform]] can be found in a Treasure Chest behind a [[Royal Guard's Sword]] in a small chamber hidden behind a [[Cracked Tile]] west of the Dining Hall. The Treasure Chest containing the [[Royal Guard Boots]] is in the Guards' Chamber on a wooden platform in between two other wooden platforms with [[Bomb Barrel]]s. The Side Quest is completed once all three pieces of the [[Royal Guard Set]] have been obtained.<ref>{{Cite|You found the {{Color BotW|Red|royal guard uniform}} from treasure chests in the hidden room near the dining hall, the storage space in the guards' chamber, and on the second floor of the castle.|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

